cff-version: 1.2.0
title: The AIRecruiter.co Talent Market Index
message: >-
  If you use this dataset, please cite it using the metadata below.
type: dataset
abstract: >-
  A free, independent, primary-sourced index of how the world hires: 107
  statistics on recruiting, hiring, and HR technology, each traced to a
  verifiable primary source (194 sources cited), plus 6
  long-run U.S. labor-market trackers built from BLS data via FRED
  (2000-2026). Compiled and maintained by AIRecruiter.co, an independent
  research publication published by HeroHunt.ai. Each figure carries an
  as-of date and an honest confidence label (verified, reported, or
  modeled); a figure with no resolvable primary source is not published.
authors:
  - name: AIRecruiter.co
    website: https://airecruiter.co
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: https://airecruiter.co/data
repository: https://github.com/herohunt-ai/talent-market-index
keywords:
  - recruiting
  - hiring
  - HR technology
  - labor market
  - talent acquisition
  - open data
date-released: 2026-09-24
version: 2026-09-24
